#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/changes.rst:245
msgid ""
"The significant update for this release is that it is compatible with the "
"latest VTK-9.x series and is known to work with VTK 9.0.1 from PyPI. The "
"picker UI has changed to no longer pop up a UI window but instead show the "
"picked attributes on the render window directly. The original picker UI is "
"now available on the scene's UI in a separate \"Picker\" tab. This is "
"accessible from either the pipeline view when one edits the properties of a "
"scene or through the \"configure scene\" gear icon on the scene window "
"toolbar."
msgstr ""

