#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/changes.rst:391
msgid ""
"Improve offscreen window creation. Creating a renderwindow in some "
"configurations can actually make UI calls.  So if EGL is available we try "
"that.  Also, when we are using offscreen rendering we only need a "
"GenericRenderWindowInteractor. Also add a convenient set method so one can "
"set a different interactor if needed."
msgstr ""

