msgid ""
"08 Sep 2018 `#712 <https://github.com/enthought/mayavi/pull/712>`_ (PR)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../mayavi/docs/source/mayavi/auto/changes.rst:398
msgid ""
"ENH: Feature to disable automatic updates. This can be very handy at times "
"when the automatic updates can trigger several changes that are not "
"desirable.  For example on certain VTK calls, internal ModifiedEvents may be"
" fired which will automatically call the update_traits method which can be "
"wired to other events triggering problems.  In these cases one can use the "
"`global_disable_update` function to temporarily disable updates."
msgstr ""

